-- The 42 Liv Bona Dea doctors the first import missed.
--
-- V22 was built from a saved copy of the hospital's directory page and caught
-- 70 of the doctors listed there. The hospital's own list now has 112; a
-- patient searching for a doctor they have been told to see, and not finding
-- them, concludes the directory is wrong - which it was. This adds the rest,
-- read from the same public profiles in the same way.
--
-- Everything V22 said still holds: none of these doctors asked to be listed,
-- so every row is UNCLAIMED with bookings off, and repeats only what the
-- hospital publishes. Photos are hosted by us, never linked.
--
-- Data only. Ten departments the hospital has that our taxonomy did not are
-- added as specialties first, so no listing lands without a translated name.

